CeladonCity_Interior17_Text_Man_1::
	.string "Meh... What do you want?\p"
	.string "Who am I?\p"
	.string "My name is ZEL, and I somehow\n"
	.string "managed to find myself into this\l"
	.string "place. Weird, ah?$"

CeladonCity_Interior17_Text_Man_2::
	.string "What? Were you expecting some kind\n"
	.string "of joke?\p"
	.string "Do I look like a comedian?$"

CeladonCity_Interior17_Text_Man_3::
	.string "What? Were you expecting that I gave\n"
	.string "you a MASTER BALL or something?\p"
	.string "I don’t even have money to buy a\n"
	.string "DS myself. Why would I give\l"
	.string "something to you?$"

CeladonCity_Interior17_Text_Man_4::
